DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260812
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260813
SUMMARY:Breakfast: Bagel w Jalapeno Cream Ch / Cocoa Berry Oats (fresh) / C
 ereal Variety
DESCRIPTION:\nBagel w Jalapeno Cream Ch\n    \n \n    \nCocoa Berry Oats (
 fresh)\n    \n \n    \nCereal Variety\n    \n \n    \nOne breakfast is a
 vailable to all students at no cost. All meals are served with fruit varie
 ty and 1% low-fat or non-fat chocolate milk (soy milk available upon reque
 st). Students must choose at least one fruit option. All grains offered ar
 e whole grain rich. Menu subject to change based on product availability.\
 n    \nThis institution is an equal opportunity provider.\n
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
SEQUENCE:0
END:VEVENT
